        "original_id": "4148d28a-fd48-52f4-8fc0-45ca7be31f91",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Hiwassee Dam, Fontana Dam, North Carolina, Swain County, Graham County\n- Organizations: Tennessee Valley Authority\n- Systems: TVA system\n- Products: Hydroelectric dams\n- Rivers: Little Tennessee River\n\nFacts:\n- Hiwassee Dam is 307 feet tall.\n- Hiwassee Dam is the third highest dam in the Tennessee Valley Authority system.\n- Fontana Dam and Watauga are the only dams in the Tennessee Valley Authority system that are higher than Hiwassee Dam.\n- Fontana Dam is a hydroelectric dam on the Little Tennessee River.\n- Fontana Dam is located in Swain County and Graham County, North Carolina, United States.",
